    ],
    "text": "Declaration by the Hon. Governor of the North Central Province Provincial Council",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      348.13,
      539.9,
      395.2
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under paragraph 8(b) of Section 154(b) of the Constitution of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, P. B. Disanayake, Governor of the North Central Province declare hereby that the forthsession of the sixth Provincial Council of the North Central Province came to end on mid-night of December 21st 2015,and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      408.13,
      539.84,
      443.2
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under paragaraph 8(a) of Section 154(b) of the aforesaid Constitution,declare hereby that the five session of the sixth Provincial Council of the North Central Province shall meet at 10.00 a. m.on 18th February 2016, at the conference hall of the North Central Provincial Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
